WEBVTT

00:00.160 --> 00:05.640
Xie Xuan you lead a unit follow me down to welcome the volunteers into the city.

00:05.720 --> 00:07.120
Your general receives orders.

00:09.560 --> 00:14.667
Yuanzhi here send people to the north to watch for Wuzhao movements.

00:15.080 --> 00:16.920
Your subject receives orders.

00:32.760 --> 00:36.280
Pay respects to you, sir rise, rise.

00:43.000 --> 01:02.000
Several internal factions, quarreling over safety and survival, escalated from bitter arguments into armed brawls, and thereafter attempted to abandon the city in anger.

